<title>USA: Proffitt's Q1 shr $0.37 vs $0.25.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's Q1 shr $0.37 vs $0.25.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter	    Quarter</p>
<p>						   Ended		Ended</p>
<p>						   5/3/97	     5/4/96</p>
<p>Total sales				   $526.4		$365.2</p>
