<p>NOTE: The company acquired  Parisian Inc on Oct. 11, 1996, in a transaction accounted for as a purchase.  Results presented include Parisian beginning with the Oct. 11, 1996 transaction date, due to the purchase accounting treatment. The company merged with G.R. Herberger's Inc on February 1, 1997, immediately before Proffitt's prior fiscal year end. Results presented have been restated to include Herberger's for the prior year, due to the pooling of interests accounting treatment.  Earnings per share numbers assume full dilution. Full company name is Profitt's Inc. --((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
